<div class="header-badge">FamilyRoots Enterprise Backend - OpenAPI Specification Guide</div>
<h1>Swagger API Routes &amp; Role Permissions Architecture</h1>

<p><strong>System:</strong> FamilyRoots Digital Lineage &amp; Sanctuary Management Platform<br>
<strong>Swagger UI URL:</strong> <code>http://localhost:8000/api/docs</code> or <code>http://localhost:8000/docs</code><br>
<strong>OpenAPI JSON:</strong> <code>http://localhost:8000/api/docs-json</code><br>
<strong>Environment:</strong> NestJS 11 + Prisma ORM 7 + PostgreSQL (Neon Serverless)<br>
<strong>Generated Date:</strong> September 23, 2026</p>

<div class="callout-success">
  <strong>Architecture Objective Achieved:</strong> Every single API route across all 10 controllers in the FamilyRoots backend now exposes explicit role permission tags directly in its Swagger summary header (e.g. <code>[Roles: MEMBER, OWNER, ADMIN]</code>, <code>[Roles: OWNER, ADMIN]</code>, <code>[Role: PUBLIC]</code>) and in its markdown description (<code>**Route:**</code>, <code>**Purpose:**</code>, <code>**Allowed Roles:**</code>, <code>**Permissions:**</code>).
</div>

<h2>1. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Hierarchy</h2>
<p>FamilyRoots enforces multi-tiered authorization based on user roles and relationship context within the sanctuary:</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Role Identifier</th>
      <th>Tier</th>
      <th>Scope of Authority &amp; System Capabilities</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span></td>
      <td>Tier 0</td>
      <td>Unauthenticated visitors. Permitted only to hit authentication ingress points (registration, login, password recovery, email confirmation) and operational health check pingers.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER / USER</span></td>
      <td>Tier 1</td>
      <td>Verified family members. Can view the sanctuary tree, browse member directory, search lineages, author personal memory stories with photos, upload archive documents up to 100MB, schedule calendar events, and attach relatives directly connected to their lineage node.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">VIEWER</span></td>
      <td>Tier 1 (Read-Only)</td>
      <td>Observer account. Can browse family sanctuary visuals, tree graphs, and shared archives without modification or deletion capabilities.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span></td>
      <td>Tier 2</td>
      <td>Family Sanctuary Creator &amp; Master Node. Full authority over their family tree, member removals, relationship matrix edits, invitation token issuance, join request approvals, sanctuary branding/settings, and document vault purges.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
      <td>Tier 3</td>
      <td>Platform Administrator. Empowered to manage multi-tenant user registries, modify user roles, audit sanctuary activity logs, and resolve cross-tenant support escalations.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
      <td>Tier 4</td>
      <td>Master Root Administrator. Unrestricted global access to all database records, platform analytics, system settings, and administrative overrides across the entire application ecosystem.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>2. Complete Route Catalog &amp; Permission Matrix</h2>

<h3>2.1. Authentication Module (<code>/auth</code>)</h3>
<p>Handles JWT token issuance, secure HTTP-only cookies, password workflows, and session lifecycle.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Route Path</th>
      <th>Summary &amp; Purpose</th>
      <th>Required Role Permissions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/signup</code></td>
      <td>Register a new user account with platform credentials.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span> (No auth required)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/signin</code></td>
      <td>Sign in with email and password to receive JWT credentials.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span> (No auth required)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/refresh</code></td>
      <td>Rotate refresh token and issue new short-lived access token.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span> (Refresh token cookie/header)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/logout</code></td>
      <td>Log out current session and clear auth cookies.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/logout-all</code></td>
      <td>Revoke all active device sessions for current user.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/me</code></td>
      <td>Get current authenticated user profile and roles.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/sessions</code></td>
      <td>List all active device sessions for current user.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/verify-email</code></td>
      <td>Verify email activation token to unlock account.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span> (Token required)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/resend-verification</code></td>
      <td>Resend email activation link.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/forgot-password</code></td>
      <td>Request password reset link via email.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/reset-password</code></td>
      <td>Reset password using unique recovery token.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-public">PUBLIC</span> (Reset token required)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/change-password</code></td>
      <td>Change password while logged in.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-patch">PATCH</span></td>
      <td><code>/auth/profile</code></td>
      <td>Update current user profile and contact details.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> (Authenticated)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.2. User Management Module (<code>/users</code>)</h3>
<p>Administrative management of platform user accounts, status switches, and roles.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Route Path</th>
      <th>Summary &amp; Purpose</th>
      <th>Required Role Permissions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/users</code></td>
      <td>Provision a new user account with specific roles.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/users</code></td>
      <td>List all platform users with pagination and search.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/users/:id</code></td>
      <td>Retrieve a specific user profile by unique ID.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-patch">PATCH</span></td>
      <td><code>/users/:id</code></td>
      <td>Update account credentials, roles, or active state.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-delete">DELETE</span></td>
      <td><code>/users/:id</code></td>
      <td>Permanently remove a user account.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.3. Family Sanctuary Core (<code>/family</code>)</h3>
<p>Sanctuary high-level statistics, branding, settings, and audit activity stream.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Route Path</th>
      <th>Summary &amp; Purpose</th>
      <th>Required Role Permissions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/sanctuary</code></td>
      <td>Retrieve core family metadata, counts, and overview stats.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-patch">PATCH</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/update</code></td>
      <td>Update primary sanctuary name, motto, and bio description.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/activity</code></td>
      <td>Retrieve recent audit activity logs with pagination and search.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/activity-logs</code></td>
      <td>Frontend compatibility alias for audit activity logs.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-patch">PATCH</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/settings</code></td>
      <td>Update privacy modes, notification toggles, and sanctuary config.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/admin/stats</code></td>
      <td>Platform-wide network metrics, tenant storage, and health.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span>, <span class="role-badge-super">SUPER_ADMIN</span> strictly</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2.4. Family Members Directory (<code>/family/members</code>)</h3>
<p>Biographical records, person nodes, deduplication search, and tree additions.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Route Path</th>
      <th>Summary &amp; Purpose</th>
      <th>Required Role Permissions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/members</code></td>
      <td>List members with pagination, multi-field search, and filters.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/members/search</code></td>
      <td>Search member profiles for deduplication and relative linking.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/members</code></td>
      <td>Create a new relative person record or link existing profile.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span> (Branch link), <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-patch">PATCH</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/members/:id</code></td>
      <td>Modify biographical information and person details.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span> (Own profile), <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-delete">DELETE</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/members/:id</code></td>
      <td>Permanently delete family member and cascade relationships.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> strictly</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

