<h3>2.8. Encrypted Documents Archive (<code>/family/documents</code>)</h3>
<p>Historical documents, land deeds, birth certificates, identity records with 100MB payload support.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Route Path</th>
      <th>Summary &amp; Purpose</th>
      <th>Required Role Permissions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-get">GET</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/documents</code></td>
      <td>Browse documents archive with category filter, search, and pagination.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/documents</code></td>
      <td>Upload single or multi-document payload up to 100MB.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-post">POST</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/documents/multiple</code></td>
      <td>Batch upload document bundles in a single atomic request.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span>, <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-delete">DELETE</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/documents/:id</code></td>
      <td>Delete a single document from the sanctuary repository.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-member">MEMBER</span> (Uploader), <span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="http-delete">DELETE</span></td>
      <td><code>/family/documents</code></td>
      <td>Purge the entire document archive for the family sanctuary.</td>
      <td><span class="role-badge-owner">OWNER</span>, <span class="role-badge-admin">ADMIN</span> strictly</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

